        "bookingUrl": "https://www.booking.com/hotel/th/pajaree-and-udos-happy-homestay.fr.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCDHNlYXJjaF90cmFuZ0gNWARoTYgBAZgBM7gBF8gBDNgBA-gBAfgBAYgCAagCAbgC2rPGzwbAAgHSAiRkMDNhNjQ5Ny0wZjgzLTQ2OTUtYWU1My05MzA1MDJjMzRlNTHYAgHgAgE&ucfs=1&arphpl=1&checkin=2027-01-15&checkout=2027-01-16&group_adults=2&req_adults=2&no_rooms=1&group_children=0&req_children=0&hpos=4&hapos=4&sr_order=popularity&nflt=review_score%3D90&srpvid=8c6827ed469400c9&srepoch=1777441248&all_sr_blocks=1105100303_385599051_2_1_0&highlighted_blocks=1105100303_385599051_2_1_0&matching_block_id=1105100303_385599051_2_1_0&sr_pri_blocks=1105100303_385599051_2_1_0__220000&from=searchresults",
